### Create a new investigation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/investigations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Why are orders stuck in Payment Processing?" }

### List recent investigations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/investigations

### Get one investigation with its evidence
GET http://localhost:8080/api/investigations/1

### Evidence only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/investigations/1/evidence
